# Download Nexitally's managed Quantumult X full configuration and run
# nexitally-node-parser.js so only [server_local] nodes are stored.
#
# Replace the placeholder with your private URL. Do not commit it.
# opt-parser=true is required; without it Quantumult X will try to treat
# the full profile as a server list.
#
# tag=Nexitally is what policy-groups.snippet matches via resource-tag-regex.
# update-interval is seconds (21600 = 6 hours). Use -1 to disable auto-sync.

<YOUR_PRIVATE_NEXITALLY_QUANTUMULT_X_URL>, tag=Nexitally, opt-parser=true, update-interval=21600, enabled=true
